---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site.js';
import Skull from '../components/Skull.astro';
import AiSeoDemo from '../components/AiSeoDemo.astro';
---
<Base title="Take Control of SEO on AI-Built Websites | Bare Bones SEO" description="Free, open-source SEO standards for AI-built static websites. Use your AI agent as a conversational SEO dashboard with visible settings, consistent output, and owner control.">
  <section class="product-hero wrap">
    <a class="back-link" href="/">← Bare Bones SEO</a>
    <div class="product-hero-layout">
      <div class="product-hero-copy">
      <h1><span class="heading-mark"><Skull size={48} /></span>Bare Bones SEO for AI-built websites</h1>
      <p class="lede">Your AI builds the website. You control its SEO.</p>
      <p class="intro">View and change SEO settings through your existing AI coding agent. No extra tools or dashboards.</p>
      <div class="product-actions">
        <a class="product-button" href="#install-title">Get started ↓</a>
        <a class="product-button product-button-secondary" href={site.staticGithub} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View on GitHub ↗</a>
      </div>
      </div>
      <AiSeoDemo />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section benefits-section" aria-labelledby="benefits-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="benefits-title">A real SEO control center—right in your AI conversation.</h2>
      <p class="benefits-intro">Not another dashboard to learn. Make your site's existing SEO settings easier to see, manage, and verify.</p>
      <ul class="benefits-grid">
        <li><strong>See your SEO settings</strong><span>Ask for titles, descriptions, canonicals, indexation directives, and sitemap entries.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Make changes by asking</strong><span>Work through your AI agent instead of hunting across files for every technical SEO decision.</span></li>
        <li><strong>One source of truth</strong><span>Keep ownership of settings clear, with fewer scattered or conflicting declarations.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Verify real output</strong><span>Check generated HTML, sitemap entries, and redirect behavior—not just configuration files.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Preserve decisions</strong><span>Persistent agent instructions help protect intentional settings through later edits.</span></li>
        <li><strong>No extra platform required</strong><span>Use your existing generator, hosting, and build tools. No mandatory service or plugin.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section examples-section" aria-labelledby="examples-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="examples-title">Ask your AI. Get answers about your site.</h2>
      <div class="examples-grid">
        <div><span class="example-label">VISIBILITY</span><p>“Show me the titles, descriptions, and canonical URLs for every service page.”</p></div>
        <div><span class="example-label">CONTROL</span><p>“Which pages are excluded from search, and where are those rules defined?”</p></div>
        <div><span class="example-label">CONSISTENCY</span><p>“Check that our sitemap and page-level robots directives agree.”</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="examples-note">Example requests after your agent implements the standards and has access to your website.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section install-section" aria-labelledby="install-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="install-title">Get started with one prompt</h2>
      <p class="install-intro">Copy these instructions into an AI coding agent with access to your website and the public GitHub repository. The agent implements the standards in your existing architecture; this is not a one-click installation.</p>
      <div class="prompt-box">
        <div class="prompt-toolbar">
          <span>Installation instructions</span>
          <button type="button" class="copy-prompt" data-copy-prompt aria-label="Copy Bare Bones SEO installation instructions">Copy prompt</button>
        </div>
        <textarea id="install-prompt" readonly rows="9" spellcheck="false" aria-label="Bare Bones SEO installation prompt">Follow the Bare Bones SEO for Static Sites standards:
https://github.com/charltondigital/bare-bones-seo-static-sites

Read the README and all applicable standards before building or changing this website. Use the existing framework, host, and build tools. Consult the relevant platform playbooks for guidance, but do not install GitHub Actions, Cloudflare, Node.js, or any other tool merely to comply.

Implement the required SEO controls for metadata, indexation, sitemaps, canonical URLs, redirects, and advisory checks. Preserve existing URLs and intentional SEO settings. Verify the actual generated HTML, sitemap, and redirect behavior—not just configuration files.

Create or update AGENTS.md so future AI coding agents know to follow these standards. Be my conversational SEO dashboard: tell me what settings and reports you can show, and offer relevant views during SEO work. Leave optimization strategy and content decisions to me unless I ask for help.</textarea>
        <p class="copy-feedback" data-copy-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section comparison-section" aria-labelledby="comparison-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="comparison-heading">
        <h2 id="comparison-title">Building the site is only half the job.</h2>
        <p>Without shared rules, even a capable AI agent can scatter technical SEO settings, overlook indexation, or unintentionally change decisions during a redesign. Bare Bones gives it standards to follow and output to verify.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="risk-benefit">
        <div class="risk-col">
          <h3>Without clear SEO standards</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>SEO may be overlooked.</strong> An AI agent focused on design or functionality may never check the indexation, metadata, or sitemap.</li>
            <li><strong>Settings can be hard to find.</strong> Titles, canonicals, and indexing rules may be scattered or duplicated.</li>
            <li><strong>Future edits can break things.</strong> A redesign or refactor may change URLs, overwrite settings, or drop redirects without warning.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-col">
          <h3>With Bare Bones SEO</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Transparency.</strong> Ask your agent to show what your site actually outputs, including titles, canonicals, indexation, and sitemaps.</li>
            <li><strong>Control.</strong> Keep technical SEO decisions in authoritative settings that you can inspect and change through conversation.</li>
            <li><strong>Consistency.</strong> Persistent instructions and advisory checks help preserve decisions and flag unexpected changes.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="comparison-note">Bare Bones doesn't make SEO decisions for you or guarantee that AI never makes mistakes. It gives your AI agent a shared specification to follow and checks to help you spot problems.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap ending">
      <h2>Professional SEO control, available to everyone.</h2>
      <p>You shouldn't need a proprietary agency platform to understand or control your website's technical SEO. Bare Bones makes these practices openly available while leaving keywords, content, and optimization strategy to you. It helps you manage and verify settings—it doesn't promise an AI agent will never make mistakes.</p>
      <a href={site.staticGithub}>Read Bare Bones SEO for Static Sites ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<script>
  const button = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-copy-prompt]');
  const prompt = document.querySelector<HTMLTextAreaElement>('#install-prompt');
  const feedback = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-copy-feedback]');
  button?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    if (!prompt) return;
    try {
      if (navigator.clipboard?.writeText) {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(prompt.value);
      } else {
        prompt.focus();
        prompt.select();
        if (!document.execCommand('copy')) throw new Error('Copy not supported');
      }
      if (feedback) feedback.textContent = 'Copied. Paste this into your AI coding agent.';
    } catch {
      prompt.focus();
      prompt.select();
      if (feedback) feedback.textContent = 'Select and copy the highlighted instructions.';
    }
  });
</script>
<style>
  .heading-mark{display:inline-flex;vertical-align:-.035em;margin-right:.2em;line-height:1}
  .heading-mark :global(svg){display:block;width:.82em;height:.82em}

  .product-hero{padding-block:var(--space-5) var(--space-6)}
  .product-hero-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.04fr) minmax(0,.96fr);gap:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5rem);align-items:center}
  .product-hero-copy{min-width:0}
  @media(max-width:54rem){.product-hero-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.product-hero-layout :global(.ai-demo){max-width:42rem}}
  .back-link{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:var(--space-3);font-size:.92rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  h1{font-size:clamp(2.15rem,4.4vw,3.6rem);max-width:24ch;font-weight:650;line-height:1.13;letter-spacing:-.035em}
  .lede{margin-top:var(--space-3);font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600}
  .intro{margin-top:var(--space-3);max-width:30rem;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.7}
  .product-actions{margin-top:var(--space-5);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:.75rem}
  .product-button{display:inline-block;padding:.85rem 1.2rem;background:var(--plate);color:var(--action-ink);text-decoration:none;border-radius:7px;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem}
  .product-button:hover{color:var(--action-ink);background:#ffe29b}
  .product-button-secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)}
  .product-button-secondary:hover{background:var(--surface-strong);color:var(--ink)}
  .note{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:var(--space-2)}
  .benefits-section{background:var(--surface);border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
  .benefits-section h2,.examples-section h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.2vw,2.45rem)}
  .benefits-intro{margin-top:var(--space-2);max-width:43rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .benefits-grid{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:var(--space-4) 0 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.75rem 2rem}
  .benefits-grid li{display:grid;align-content:start;gap:.45rem;border-left:3px solid var(--plate);padding-left:1rem}
  .benefits-grid strong{font-size:1.04rem;line-height:1.35}
  .benefits-grid span{font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .examples-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem;margin-top:var(--space-3)}
  .examples-grid>div{padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:var(--surface)}
  .example-label{font-size:.73rem;letter-spacing:.07em;font-weight:750;color:var(--plate)}
  .examples-grid p{font-size:1.03rem;font-weight:580;line-height:1.5;margin-top:.7rem}
  .examples-note{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:var(--space-2)}
  @media(max-width:54rem){.benefits-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
  @media(max-width:44rem){.examples-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  @media(max-width:36rem){.benefits-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .install-intro{color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:42rem;margin-top:var(--space-2);margin-bottom:var(--space-3)}
  .prompt-box{border:1px solid var(--line);max-width:52rem;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface)}
  .prompt-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding:.75rem 1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);font-size:.83rem;font-weight:700}
  .copy-prompt{background:var(--plate);color:var(--action-ink);border:0;border-radius:6px;padding:.65rem 1rem;font:inherit;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}
  .copy-prompt:hover{background:#ffe29b}
  .copy-prompt:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--plate);outline-offset:3px}
  #install-prompt{display:block;width:100%;min-height:19rem;padding:1.1rem;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);border:0;resize:vertical;font:.82rem/1.7 var(--mono)}
  .copy-feedback{min-height:1.6rem;padding:.2rem 1rem .5rem;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,2.5rem)}
  .comparison-heading{max-width:47rem;margin-bottom:var(--space-3)}
  .comparison-heading p{margin-top:var(--space-2);color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .risk-benefit{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}
  .risk-col,.benefit-col{padding:clamp(1.25rem,3vw,2rem);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px}
  .risk-col{background:var(--surface)}
  .benefit-col{background:var(--surface-strong);border-color:var(--line)}
  .risk-benefit h3{font-size:1.35rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem}
  .risk-benefit ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:1.3rem}
  .risk-benefit li{line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .risk-benefit strong{display:block;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:.25rem}
  .comparison-note{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:var(--space-3);max-width:49rem}
  .ending{display:grid;gap:1rem}
  .ending p{max-width:39rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .ending a{font-weight:600}
  @media(max-width:44rem){.risk-benefit{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
